  "axes": {
   "r": 0,
   "p": 1,
   "y": 2
  },
  "rule": "w = log(R_local) of the BVH joint (deg, BVH axes; 6-channel joints: the rotation). robot <limb>-<joint>-<c> = sign_c * w[src[c]], clamped to the joint limits. axisSign cumulative (bvh-demo.l rikiya :copy-joint-to-): sign starts at signs[limb-joint] (1), then for r, p, y in this order it is negated when the robot joint exists and its axis component (x, y, z) is negative (the negation carries over). axisSign none: sign = 1. Other joints: reset-pose. calibrate (lafan1): angle - (angle at frame 0 - reset-pose), clamped. Root: rotation = C (G_root G_root(0)^T) C^T, C = Rz(-yaw of the root at frame 0); position = s_leg x (root - root(0)) horizontally, the lower foot on the floor."
 },
